      "cooked": "<p>I was playing a game. The heroes were Fanatic, Grandpa, Mr. Fixer and Tempest in the Insula.</p><p>About 6 turns in Spite managed to have all his drugs in play; Mynd-Phyre, Demon's Kiss, PL602 Compound Omicron, PL626 Compound XI, and PL531 Compound Upsilon.</p><p>Spite was whomping on the heroes as Spite was wont to do. Around the 8th turn, Mr. Fixer managed to get his Grease Gun in play.</p><p>Mynd-Phyre: no damage.</p><p>Demon's Kiss: no damage.</p><p>PL626: no damage.</p><p>PL531: Grease Gun goes back into Fixer's hand for the next play.</p>",
